                        "entry_id": "6ca18309-73b5-327a-96ef-517b8b866973",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Agitated, confusing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d180ee27-ed4f-43a4-a6ca-6e5bffaa4674",
                                "sense_id": "092091f2-05fe-31b4-8e1b-c34e25af303d",
                                "text": "To me it seems, Mabel, that whenever a thing is really grand and potent, it has a quiet majesty about it, that is altogether unlike the frothy and flustering manner of smaller matters, and so it was with them rapids."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc2ef070-8a22-4453-a78d-3f8220d4f736",
                                "sense_id": "092091f2-05fe-31b4-8e1b-c34e25af303d",
                                "text": "There is always a flustering breeze in the air and a perturbation generally through the county when they come or go, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d858949e-59ea-4eb3-bb31-c72b1f89cb17",
                                "sense_id": "092091f2-05fe-31b4-8e1b-c34e25af303d",
                                "text": "Although at times my prac experiences were flustering and frustrating, I have gained many new insights into catering for the individual needs of children."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63445f49-1356-4358-85c6-55455b8c8042",
                                "sense_id": "092091f2-05fe-31b4-8e1b-c34e25af303d",
                                "text": "There is nothing more flustering than to wrestle with an unfamiliar piece of equipment in the presence of a class!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0d27ad6-64c8-4e41-a4d9-8ee965955b46",
                                "sense_id": "092091f2-05fe-31b4-8e1b-c34e25af303d",
                                "text": "She almost forgot Toby while she was bathed in this flustering brilliance of light and noise."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9b13283-dfc7-3ab9-901c-9a277169b5e0",
                        "entry_id": "6ca18309-73b5-327a-96ef-517b8b866973",
